Not an architect that makes cool forms on the computer. Not an architect that sees everything through the lens of theory. But an architect who wants to build, wants to build well and wants to learn and build more and build better and to do everything. The thing that makes me happiest is to see that she's now being recognized for her real role. Young people are learning about her in a very different way. We didn't even learn about her, to be honest. I mean I learned about her because I knew some people at Skidmore who really admired her and they told me about her. I'm just so glad that she now is someone to look up to for men and
不是那种在电脑上做出炫酷形态的建筑师。不是那种通过理论视角看待一切的建筑师。而是一位渴望建造、渴望建好、渴望学习并建造更多、建造得更好并把一切都做好的建筑师。最让我开心的是看到她现在因其真正的角色而受到认可。年轻人正以一种非常不同的方式了解她。老实说，我们甚至都没有学过她。我的意思是，我了解她是因为我认识一些斯金默事务所里非常崇拜她的人，他们向我讲述了她。我太高兴了，她现在成为了男性和

